        "title": "Exquisite Materials",
        "text": "<p><br/>We work closely with our partner mills and ateliers across Japan, regularly visiting suppliers to thoughtfully select each fabric and component. Every detail is chosen with care, ensuring exceptional quality, comfort, and integrity at every stage of production. The result is workwear you don’t just see, but experience—through the way each piece moves with you, supports you, and elevates the everyday.<br/><br/></p>",
